OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal after rottweiler
OL,4,Abites teenage girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,7,Fafter a girl suffered "ABH-level
OL,8,Finjuries" when she was bitten by a
OL,9,Frottweiler in Surrey.
OL,11,FSurrey Police said the attack took
OL,12,Fplace in an alleyway in
OL,13,FStaines-Upon-Thames last month.
OL,15,FThe victim was walking in the lane
OL,16,Fbetween Kingston Road and Hazel Grove
OL,17,Fat around 17:50 BST on 10 September
OL,18,Fwhen the animal "lunged" at her.
OL,20,FOfficers are appealing for witnesses to
OL,21,Fcontact the force with any information
OL,22,Fwith might help the investigation.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
